    its materials). You can only use each of the following effects of "DoomZ XIII
    Over - Graflareio" once per turn. You can detach 1 material from this card; add
    1 "DoomZ" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand, then you can destroy 1 card
    on the field. If this card is destroyed by card effect: You can Special Summon
    1 non-Xyz "DoomZ" monster from your Deck or GY.'
